# (build 163) The retranslation's text in a message window: Aukba's weapon
# store (ac_slasher_name's), the fourth item. His 0602 types "The {item},
# huh?" and a line break: the item's name is his names.json's, whole --
# "Laconia Slicer", fourteen letters, past the stock ten -- and the line
# is a run in his face (ink 1 on the window's paper), a glyph a frame.
# The pixel is the top of the T: his capitals start on the cell's top
# row, where the stock font's have paper.
start building 5 13 5 18
language retranslation
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect script $0602
expect text "The Laconia Slicer, huh?"
expect text "Who'll carry it?"
expect pixel 24 176 $EEE
shot 01_laconia_slicer
